<p>Trees, grass and shrubberies are handled somewhat differently from other models. They are created using a program called <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/SpeedTree" title="SpeedTree">SpeedTree</a> that includes information allowing them to respond to the wind. 
</p>
